23,"record_id":"MLDB-000726","detection":"UV-Vis","method_description":"Lipophilicity of the complexes was evaluated by standard shake-flask method. Octanolwater (1:1 v/v) mixture was used in the study. Solutions (50 μM) of complexes 1-12 were prepared using octanol saturated water and treated with equal amount of water-octanol mixture. The mixture was kept for shaking for 24 h. After the separation of two layers, the absorbance values were evaluated using electronic spectroscopy. The log Po/w values were calculated using the equation, log Po/w = log (Corg/Caq), where Corg refers to the concentration of complexes in organic layer and Caq refers to the concentration in aqueous layer."}],"ccdc":["QILYET"]}